.TH "gnutls_hpke_export_pubkey" 3 "3.8.14" "gnutls" "gnutls"
.SH NAME
gnutls_hpke_export_pubkey \- API function
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <gnutls/hpke.h>
.sp
.BI "int gnutls_hpke_export_pubkey(const gnutls_hpke_context_t " ctx ", const gnutls_pubkey_t " pubkey ", gnutls_datum_t * " pubkey_raw ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "const gnutls_hpke_context_t ctx" 12
The HPKE context to use for exporting the public key.
.IP "const gnutls_pubkey_t pubkey" 12
An initialized public key.
.IP "gnutls_datum_t * pubkey_raw" 12
A pointer to a gnutls_datum_t structure where the exported raw public key data will be stored.
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
This function exports raw public key data from  \fIpubkey\fP , which
must be compatible with the HPKE context  \fIctx\fP .

The function will allocate memory for  \fIpubkey_raw\fP , and the caller is
responsible for freeing this memory using \fBgnutls_free()\fP when it is
no longer needed.
.SH "RETURNS"
0 on success, or a negative error code on failure
